*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Environment variables.
# Public-value mode files (.env.development, .env.production) ARE tracked
# because their only contents are VITE_API_URL, which is a public value
# (the VITE_ prefix exposes it to client bundles by design). Per
# SECURITY.md section 1, public-value env files may be committed, and the
# ignore rule must not contradict them. Only files that can carry secrets
# or local overrides are ignored here.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Testing
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Misc
*.log
.cache/